       both the Linux isofs9660 filesystem and the  mkisofs  utility,  and  is
       currently  maintaining  them.  The copyright for the mkisofs utility is
       held by Yggdrasil Computing, Incorporated.

       mmkkhhyybbrriidd is based on mmkkiissooffss and works in exactly the same way  as  mmkk‐‐
       iissooffss without the HFS options. The change in name is to signify that it
