       file  has it's TYPE set as 'TEXT', it _m_a_y be read incorrectly on a Mac‐
       intosh. Therefore a better choice for the default TYPE may be '????'

       The _-_m_a_c_-_b_o_o_t_-_f_i_l_e option may not work at all...

       The _-_a option should be used at all times. It may well become  the  de‐
